      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## TBG_Enhanced Tiled Upscaler and Refiner PRO   V1.1.18\n\n[https://github.com/Ltamann/ComfyUI-TBG-ETUR](https://github.com/Ltamann/ComfyUI-TBG-ETUR)      \n\n\n[black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-kv-fp8](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-kv-fp8)\n\n## TBG-ETUR FLUX.2-klein Reference image upscale\n[PRO requires an API key — here’s how to set it up]( https://www.patreon.com/posts/138215572)\n\n[As member you can pickup the API key here’s](https://api.tbgetur.com/)\n\n## Model links (for local users)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-9b-kv-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n\n**lora**\n\n- [Flux2-Klein-9B-consistency-V2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/dx8152/Flux2-Klein-9B-Consistency/blob/main/Flux2-Klein-9B-consistency-V2.safetensors)\n\n- [adonis_flux2klein Base + Refiner](https://huggingface.co/n8te0/adonis_flux2klein)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │      └── flux-2-klein-9b-kv-fp8.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │      └── qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│          └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
