      "widgets_values": [
        "We have three ways to load VLMs:\n\n1. **Standard** – Fully automatic setup. Supports all models except GGUF.\n\n2. **GGUF** – Often requires a manual llama.cpp server installation, which can be complicated for some configurations. We provide prebuilt wheels, and installation is only required if you select the GGUF option.\n\n3. **Fastest and Best Option: OpenAI-Compatible (Labs Server)** – Connect the Labs_upscaler node and enter the URL, port, and model name of your local or API-based Ollama or llama.cpp server with the Qwen GGUF model loaded.\n\n4. Florence has now been fixed to run on Transformer versions 5 and above.\n"
      ],
